sieve-filter-v1
; The built-in words-v2, written in the token form: words-data-v1 with trailing padding, so the last
; unit of a text (its words, then SPACEs to the end) passes. It must judge and count exactly as
; words-v2 does, with the same dictionary.
id        words-data
version   2
author    Edward James Gordon (written with Claude)
origin    ai-directed
lines     text
symbols   lower27
describe  Every token is a complete dictionary word, and a unit may end in SPACE padding (words-v2, as a plugin).
param     dictionary  dict  default  the word list (a registered dictionary)

tokens    separator " "
edges     whole
padding   trailing
set       word  dict:{dictionary}
end
